WEBVTT

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.480
A roadside shrine?

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.770
Yeah, it's supposed to 
be around here somewhere.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.850
You mean one of those shrines 
devoted to gods and stuff, right?

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.940
Why are you looking for that now?

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:16.490
Well, the other day...

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.320
Are you okay?

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.370
I-It's my chronic pains.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Could you please rub my back?

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.300
Thank you very much.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.640
I'll tell you something 
interesting in return.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:41.250
Are you aware of a roadside 
shrine in this area?

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:41.640
Huh?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.630
There's a rumor that strange 
voices come from it.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:51.080
You must never go near it.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.730
Wouldn't that just make you 
even more curious to see it?

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.240
Huh?

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.120
Could that be it?

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.260
Oh jeez, it's broken.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.220
I don't hear any voices.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.340
But from what she said...

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.520
Help!

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>It's a kid's voice.</i>

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.160
Help!

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.510
Help!

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.030
<i>It's not just one voice.</i>

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:27.440
<i>Two? Three?</i>

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:32.530
Kids' hands?

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:35.130
<i>I have to tell Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:42.550
Tch.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.880
Voices of the Roadside Shrine

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:25.510
<i>Rokudou had no trouble purifying 
the spirits I couldn't exorcise.</i>

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.100
<i>How are we any different?</i>

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.050
He's a kind shinigami.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.190
Mamiya-san.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.170
Yes?

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.490
Oh, um...

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.880
Never mind me, what are you doing here?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.320
You weren't looking for me—

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.950
Shoot, I have to hurry.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.580
I need to see Rokudou-kun.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:58.750
Wait, Mamiya-san.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.470
Rokudou-kun, are you here?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.240
Mamiya Sakura.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.470
A mummy!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.100
Take this, Ho—

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.350
Don't be so hasty, Jumonji.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.100
He's a client.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.480
Class 1-3, Nekota Taro.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.460
Um, what's with the bandage?

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.250
My brother in elementary school got me.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.450
He's been acting strange 
since a few days ago.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.240
No one in my family knows what to do.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.140
So, Mamiya Sakura, did you 
need something from me?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.790
Oh, I just wanted to ask you about something.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.590
But I can wait until you're done with that.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.250
<i>Talk? Is something troubling her?</i>

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.910
<i>But she could talk to me.</i>

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.850
<i>Does it have to be Rokudou?</i>

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.850
My brother Hiroshi is in fifth grade.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.350
He's a normal kid. A little shy.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:04:59.980
Wow.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.470
<i>What's this evil aura?</i>

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.660
<i>Is it an evil spirit?</i>

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.910
My brother Hiroshi.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:18.040
Mom, I want more fish, meow.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.410
Wow.

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.960
Wh-What the...

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.800
What's gotten into you, Hiroshi?

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.000
Maybe it's just me, but he's 
become kind of cat-like.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.800
It's not just you.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.800
<i>This kid...</i>

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.240
It looks like he's been possessed.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.130
Damn evil spirit!

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:36.840
No.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.090
It's not an evil spirit.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.150
What?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:39.940
Rokumon.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.320
Yes, Rinne-sama?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.940
<i>Shinigami's scythe.</i>

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:51.350
<i>It'd been in the pawn shop for a long time, 
but Rinne got it back for 5,000 yen.</i>

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:56.060
<i>With this, exorcisms are a breeze.</i>

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:59.210
<i>A must-have for any shinigami!</i>

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.370
You're not Hiroshi, are you?

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.990
Where's the real Hiroshi?

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.340
It's not Hiroshi?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.050
Cat monster!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.300
You're not one of them?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.930
I don't sense any human in him.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:17.120
A cat monster is impersonating Hiroshi.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.960
Time for a walk!

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:22.230
Wait!

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:23.570
Rokudou-kun!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.420
Not to worry.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:29.490
I have my shinigami scythe. 
He's no match for me!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.990
It broke!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.620
He got away.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.670
I got this!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.890
Tsubasa-kun.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.380
It snapped right in half.

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:57.630
It was in the pawn shop for so long.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.390
It hadn't been maintained properly.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:04.360
Still, though, it's not 
supposed to break so easily.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.860
Pawn Shop

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.860
Aw, man!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:11.620
It's them.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.300
Scythe bugs.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:17.760
Well, what's done is done.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.890
I'm sure I can get it fixed.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:22.800
But it'll cost you money again.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.010
What can I do?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.740
I'll do what I can for now.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.720
That cat monster said it's 
"time for a walk," though.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:35.700
I wonder what he meant?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.770
He's been going out just about 
every night these past few days.

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.500
We try to stop him and he goes nuts.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:47.400
Speaking of which, I heard some 
of his classmates are missing.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:48.650
Eh?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:55.570
Two of the four people in his cram 
school clique, Yuji-kun and Koji-kun.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.190
I'm told the other one, Taichi-kun, is safe.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.350
One left.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.200
Rokumon-chan.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.760
Can I talk to you?

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.010
<i>I'm not letting you get away.</i>

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.940
<i>I </i>need<i> to impress Mamiya-san this time.</i>

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:37.540
<i>This should be the room that the 
Hiroshi lookalike cat monster ran to.</i>

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.350
Yes?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.140
Sakura-sama, what do you mean, 
something's bothering you?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.340
I wanted to talk to 
Rokudou-kun about it, but...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.580
Help me!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.530
I'm scared!

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:02.280
I thought they might be kids' spirits,

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.400
but they don't seem like the 
spirits I usually sense.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.400
Could it be...

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.650
Is that you in there, Hiroshi-kun?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.280
You can hear my voice?

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.900
A cat monster caught us and locked us up.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.590
<i>Cat monster?</i>

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.090
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.410
Are your friends with you?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.470
Yeah.

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.950
My friends Yuji and Koji from cram school.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.660
And Taichi-kun's here, too.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:30.000
Taichi-kun? But I heard 
Taichi-kun's still safe.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.880
Huh? No one's been here.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:35.580
Lying won't work in your favor.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:39.770
I'm certain it jumped 
onto this room's balcony.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:42.220
Why are you going after it, Onii-san?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.770
It's a cat monster.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.310
I can't let it roam free. He's dangerous.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.200
Dangerous?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.060
Like...

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.860
Like this?

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:58.110
Now that you know our true 
identities, we can't let you live.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.620
There was another one?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.380
<i>I'm paralyzed!</i>

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.060
Special move, Nekodamashi!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:16.420
What do we do with you now?

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.530
Don't move, Jumonji!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.970
Don't worry, I <i>can't</i> move!

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.520
Tch.

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.270
<i>Rokudou.</i>

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:37.410
We were having fun sharing scary stories 
on our way home from cram school.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:43.900
And there was a lady in a kimono 
by this roadside shrine.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:47.170
A woman in a kimono?

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.060
Yeah.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:52.440
At first we were surprised; 
we thought she was an actual monster.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.880
But she wasn't.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.010
Boys, have you heard?

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:02.280
There's a cat monster here that's been 
sealed in this shrine since the Edo period.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.930
Yeah, I know.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.260
But I heard it was a tanuki monster.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.910
Huh? I heard it was a fox.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.680
Oh, right.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:17.890
It might have been a fox.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:18.900
Right?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.530
Then let's look inside and check.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.570
Okay, it's open.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:26.420
You broke it.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.040
What? It's empty.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.630
Lame.

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.040
There's nothing inside.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:40.550
But it was empty inside, 
and we each went our own ways.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.460
What was that lady doing, anyway?

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:51.290
Thanks for wrecking our shrine!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:56.400
And meanwhile, Taichi-kun was being 
attacked by another cat monster.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:03.050
And you all got caught one after 
another and trapped in this shrine.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.710
Exactly.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.920
Please, help us, Onee-san.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.910
I found it, Sakura-sama.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:19.300
Cat Monster Encyclopedia

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.290
<i>Cat Monster Encyclopedia.</i>

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.340
<i>Everything you've ever wanted 
to know about cat monsters.</i>

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:18.930
<i>Belongs to Rokumon, and so is free!</i>

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:24.930
It was a duo of cat monsters that was 
sealed here: Akamaru and Toramaru.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.810
They caused mischief masquerading 
as children living

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.030
in the neighborhood during the Edo period.

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:33.880
It also explains how to capture them, but...

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.940
Really? That's good.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.020
We have to tell Rokudou-kun right away.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.220
We're finally out of the shrine.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.950
Time to do all the evil we can!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.750
Relaxant lozenges.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:13:00.630
Have these and you'll 
eventually be unparalyzed.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.540
It's 150 yen, by the way.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:06.640
<i>I won't thank you, Rokudou. 
Not that I can speak.</i>

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.430
<i>Now that I can't use my scythe...</i>

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.140
<i>I'll have to try it.</i>

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.330
Fire wheel!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.660
<i>Fire wheel.</i>

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:23.650
<i>The same powerful item that Rinne bought 
before using Mamiya Sakura's 500 yen.</i>

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:27.390
<i>By the way, he has no 
means of paying her back.</i>

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.910
Fire Wheel Fissioning!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:42.670
Wait!

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.670
<i>Cats love things that move.</i>

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.390
I'll go stop them!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.220
Rokumon-chan.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.580
Mrowwr!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.290
Rokumon-chan.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:09.990
Mamiya Sakura. Rokumon.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.280
Rokudou-kun!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.420
Seal the cat monsters again,

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.600
otherwise the kids can't 
get out of the shrine!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:18.870
Seal them, huh?

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.040
<i>But how?</i>

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.500
<i>They've made my fire wheel their plaything. 
I don't what else might be effective.</i>

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.300
Rokudou-kun.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:30.050
We know how to seal them.

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.050
What?

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.430
<i>The people, troubled by the cat monsters,</i>

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.900
<i>built a wonderfully powerful roadside shrine</i>

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:39.190
<i>and put in it the cat 
monsters' favorite things.</i>

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:43.940
<i>The cat monsters jumped 
straight into the shrine,</i>

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.130
<i>and they were sealed on the spot.</i>

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:50.110
Their favorite things?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.200
What?

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:52.580
Tuna!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:53.710
Fatty tuna!

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.960
Denied.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:01.110
You can't, huh?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.760
That tuna was delicious.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.820
I want more.

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.590
Will you give us some?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:14.070
<i>Isn't there anything cheaper that'll work?</i>

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.670
<i>I know!</i>

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.350
Mamiya Sakura, Rokumon!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:21.560
Take me to the shrine!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.540
What a fool.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.650
We aren't going near that shrine!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.770
Not even now?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:38.870
His broken shinigami scythe's 
working like a cat toy.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.150
Do you really think...

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:43.460
...we would fall for that?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.880
<i>Cats love things that move.</i>

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:06.980
There.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.440
No you don't!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.790
Rokudou-kun!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.770
I finally caught four.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:24.630
Now I only have one!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.200
It's this lady!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.630
She's the one that told us about the shrine!

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:32.300
Well, the cat's out of the bag.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:36.610
You were right to suspect I am a damashigami!

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:38.990
You were a damashigami?

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:41.100
<i>No one suspected anything.</i>

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:46.100
Oh, well, I guess I'll just take 
this one back to the afterlife.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:47.900
Up we go.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.400
Tsubasa-kun.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:03.370
Is Rokudou in there?

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.020
Help him, please!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:08.170
Damashigamis take people to the 
afterlife even if they're not dead.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.420
If we don't do something, Rokudou-kun is...

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.260
<i>Mamiya-san.</i>

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.600
Jumonji?!

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:28.950
We're even now, Rokudou.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.130
Tch.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.320
You've done it now, damashigami!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.840
Fine, then! Sic 'em, boys!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:40.530
Why would we listen to you?

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.900
Huh?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:48.500
I was the one that spread rumors about the 
shrine so that the humans would open it!

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:50.520
So...

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:54.140
There were always cat monsters in the shrine,

00:17:54.140 --> 00:18:00.530
and the damashigami spread rumors about 
it thinking it'd make good human bait,

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:06.610
and the kids that got baited in broke 
it, and let out the cat monsters.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:11.270
So you were just using them all along.

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:18.860
On the other hand, now that you know who 
we are, we'll have to deal with you.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.320
Rokudou.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.850
Leave this to me.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.000
All right, but what do 
you plan to do, Jumonji?

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.490
I have another trick up my sleeve.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:31.600
Heyo!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.880
sushi

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:32.880
Matsu Sushi here!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:36.900
I'm here to deliver your order!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.500
Behold!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.050
It's magnificent!

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:45.930
Fatty tuna sushi set!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.810
30,000 yen!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.940
Fatty tuna!

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:57.080
Now, cat monsters, eat 
to your heart's content!

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:59.720
This is yours!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.050
Brute force again?

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:06.810
Shut up!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.960
I said I had a trick up my sleeve.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.390
Is this what I think it is?

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:32.130
Yeah, Special Flavored Holy Ash!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.150
Rich Cat Powder Flavor!

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:40.730
<i>Cat powder is like catnip: Cats love 
it, and it makes them act drunk!</i>

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:42.790
I feel so good.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:47.670
And I got to have fatty tuna. I'm content now.

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:59.860
Tsubasa-kun exorcised the cat monsters.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.180
No, he made them rest in peace.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.010
Wh-what...

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.140
Where are you going?

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.140
No!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.070
And so the cat monster 
situation came to a close.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:28.040
I didn't think you'd make them rest in 
peace by giving them what they liked.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.440
That was impressive.

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:32.210
It's not like I was doing 
things your way or anything.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.350
Thank you.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.830
Sorry for causing trouble.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:38.710
Yeah.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:42.350
There are things in this world that 
you should be careful about touching.

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:46.510
You can cause unthinkable disasters.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:52.770
But those cat monsters were being 
manipulated, in a way, too.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:57.110
They were able to rest in the end, 
so I guess things turned out okay.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.900
Come to think of it, I feel bad for them.

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:05.700
Rinne-sama, you're awesome.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:09.080
<i>"A kind shinigami," huh?</i>

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:11.600
We'll reflect on this.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.580
Hey, so, I don't want to call this 
an apology or anything, but...

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.330
I'll give you 1,000 yen. Please forgive us.

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:21.390
Are you sure, Young Master?!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:22.800
Thank you, sir!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.380
You're miserable to look at, Rinne-sama.

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:29.270
<i>I never want to do things his way.</i>

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.580
Repair plans.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.130
Should I do the 500 yen 
plan or the 1,000 yen plan?

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:40.570
 Repairs

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:40.570
 We'll help with anything

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:38.300
The 1,000 yen, obviously.

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:40.570
Hurry up and choose, please.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:48.660
Like I said, I couldn't fill my quota 
because this weird shinigami got in my way!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:54.600
I worked so hard to raise my record 
and make myself useful to you, boss!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.710
Hey, now, it's the thought that counts.

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.800
Boss.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.890
Boss, enough flirting.

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:20.060
Oh, right, so describe this shinigami to me.

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:22.180
Umm...

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:23.460
Oh,

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:27.100
he had red hair, like you, Boss.

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:29.930
Oh?

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode
 Curse of the Rabbit Hutch

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:04.240
You don't seem to be living 
very comfortably, Rokudou-kun.

00:24:04.240 --> 00:24:05.040
Are you okay?

00:24:05.250 --> 00:24:06.920
I'm used to it.

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.380
Besides, it's not as if I was always poor.

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:11.100
I was a semi-buru when I was a kid.

00:24:11.100 --> 00:24:12.100
Semi-buru?

00:24:12.100 --> 00:24:13.590
Semi-bourgeois.

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.590
A kind-of affluent household.

00:24:15.590 --> 00:24:19.220
In the summer, I had 
popsicles nearly every day.

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:21.010
Does that mean you're rich?

00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:24.550
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"Curse of the Rabbit Hutch."

00:24:24.550 --> 00:24:25.980
Semi-buru?
